	<!-- ============================================================
	     Raid window restyled to match the Alternate Advancement window
	     - standard rounded window frame (WDT_Rounded), borderless steel / gold tabs
	     - member lists use their own column headings (always aligned with the columns);
	       the drawn column guides, header ticks and header lines are gone
	     - lists, notes and MOTD sit in dark insets with the slim scrollbar (WDT_ItemPanel)
	     - Raid / Groups / Roles &amp; Loot panels keep the AA side-panel style, with small gold headers
	     - regular buttons (BDT_Normal); dimmed steel labels with white values
	     ============================================================ -->
